#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:1
#: d39e12bb9e4c4b998b6440256a6ca5f2
msgid "超参数自动化搜索"
msgstr "Automated Hyperparameter Search"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:3
#: ed1bde6f0c9644e0bb3d18cebb1ef08a
msgid ""
"本指南介绍如何使用 UniKT 内置的 Optuna "
"超参数搜索运行器（`optuna_search.py`），对知识追踪模型的超参数进行单目标贝叶斯调优或多目标帕累托前沿搜索，以及如何断点恢复试验并分析搜索结果数据库。"
msgstr ""
"This guide introduces how to use UniKT's built-in Optuna search runner "
"(`optuna_search.py`) for single-objective Bayesian tuning or multi-"
"objective Pareto frontier searches on knowledge tracing models, resume "
"interrupted trials, and analyze search study databases."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:5
#: b777490aa95b456e871e1f3b9a3a5465
msgid "目标与适用场景"
msgstr "Objectives & Use Cases"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:7
#: a5063ed0306645cea96b719d58196231
msgid "针对特定数据集寻找最佳学习率、批大小、嵌入维度、层数或模型专属超参数。"
msgstr ""
"Finding optimal learning rates, batch sizes, embedding dimensions, layer "
"counts, or model-specific hyperparameters for target datasets."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:8
#: b59fa9cf08c04c24a3d2bd94d53168d7
msgid "支持单目标优化（如最大化 AUC、最小化 RMSE）与多目标优化（如同时兼顾 AUC 与 RMSE）。"
msgstr ""
"Supports single-objective optimization (e.g., maximizing AUC, minimizing "
"RMSE) and multi-objective optimization (e.g., balancing AUC and RMSE "
"simultaneously)."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:9
#: 6f06d427010e4de498874c3452585024
msgid "支持试验异常中断后的无损断点恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Supports lossless checkpoint resumption after unexpected trial "
"interruptions."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:10
#: 0853459f7488439e88e3cb01604056c9
msgid "搜索完成后自动生成最佳参数配置 `best_run_config.yaml`，便于直接一键复现重跑。"
msgstr ""
"Automatically generates `best_run_config.yaml` containing the optimal "
"configuration upon search completion for one-click reproduction."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:12
#: 74fc166ea9664e08b63f5f19d445fccc
msgid "前置条件"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:14
#: 275b95e303ed4742913ab4251960c4c3
msgid "**环境准备**：Pixi 环境已内置安装 Optuna。"
msgstr "**Environment**: Optuna is pre-installed in the Pixi environment."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:15
#: da4a49203dc94f1c81ac811edf10700c
msgid "**数据就绪**：目标数据集已完成预处理。"
msgstr "**Data Readiness**: Target datasets must be preprocessed beforehand."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:16
#: 5b2e45e0bd7042e0afe5c1f367c35396
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**搜索空间元数据已注册**：各模型的搜索空间直接在模型专属的 `ModelConfig` 类中通过 `metadata={'optuna': "
"...}` 声明。无需手动编写或维护冗余的 JSON 参数文件。"
msgstr ""
"**Registered Search Space Metadata**: Search spaces are declared directly"
" in model-specific `ModelConfig` classes via `metadata={'optuna': ...}`, "
"eliminating the need to maintain redundant JSON parameter files."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:18
#: 8e65f3573a50415383049b2c2ab7bb5c
msgid "运行超参数搜索"
msgstr "Running Hyperparameter Search"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:20
#: 4eeab40de1e940c3999c6aa11a4f0cf9
msgid "1. 单目标优化"
msgstr "1\\. Single-Objective Optimization"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:22
#: d8c7b19d62ff4574a3b6cb7143875aef
msgid "最常用的场景是最大化验证集 AUC："
msgstr "The most common scenario is maximizing validation set AUC:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:24
#: be4fc78a1faf4311b7168db9004da5d6
msgid ""
"python optuna_search.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --optuna_search.metric "
"auc\n"
msgstr ""
"python optuna_search.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --optuna_search.metric "
"auc\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:28
#: 7bf078a1d6a2419baad38ec5b053135e
msgid "此命令将读取 `configs/optuna/optuna_config.yaml` 中的全局配置，并结合 GIKT 模型定义的搜索空间执行试验。"
msgstr ""
"This command reads global settings from "
"`configs/optuna/optuna_config.yaml` and executes trials across the search"
" space defined by GIKT."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:30
#: 277c2285e4fa4c33b9556a960b57dcb1
msgid "2. 多目标帕累托优化"
msgstr "2\\. Multi-Objective Pareto Optimization"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:32
#: 80d61df0f60d42979406e1682702eef5
msgid "当需要同时权衡 AUC 与 RMSE 时，可以传入以逗号分隔的多个指标："
msgstr "When balancing AUC and RMSE concurrently, pass comma-separated metrics:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:34
#: fc70e155151b4758a25186f4221ab0e8
msgid ""
"python optuna_search.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --optuna_search.metric "
"auc,rmse\n"
msgstr ""
"python optuna_search.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --optuna_search.metric "
"auc,rmse\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:39
#: b7b0bac95c064d2e810c71679169bece
msgid ""
"当传入多个指标时，系统自动切换为多目标优化（例如 `auc` 设为 `maximize`，`rmse` 设为 "
"`minimize`）。进行多目标搜索时，建议将采样器设置为 `nsgaii`。"
msgstr ""
"Passing multiple metrics automatically switches the search to multi-"
"objective optimization (e.g., `auc` set to `maximize`, `rmse` set to "
"`minimize`). The `nsgaii` sampler is recommended for multi-objective "
"sweeps."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:42
#: 8006b9c6001c4d83ab377a03227dc371
msgid "3. 命令行参数对照"
msgstr "3\\. Command-Line Arguments Reference"

