#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:38
#: c6b06aac6ece4c278bc8b0b5c7298d41
msgid "`--optuna_search.output_dir`"
msgstr "`--optuna_search.output_dir`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:38
#: 3a8ab69c23de41d4970d4388794791b3
msgid "指定固定输出目录（供 Web 后端或自动化脚本确定性定位 `study.db`）"
msgstr ""
"Specify fixed output directory (used by Web backends or automation "
"scripts to locate `study.db`)"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:54
#: 0b26068a5908423e97484b7ded945258
msgid ""
"除上述选项外，所有通用的 `--data.*` 和 `--general.*` 参数均可直接透传（例如 `--data.fold 0` 或 "
"`--general.device cuda:0`）。"
msgstr ""
"In addition to these options, all general `--data.*` and `--general.*` "
"arguments can be passed directly (e.g., `--data.fold 0` or "
"`--general.device cuda:0`)."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:56
#: 05f169c2a43f4701b656fa8bb9efdfe8
msgid "配置全局搜索参数：`optuna_config.yaml`"
msgstr "Configuring Global Search Parameters: `optuna_config.yaml`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:58
#: 6f943da0dc3841f0b12c7729fbfb5ed0
msgid "全局搜索控制文件位于 `configs/optuna/optuna_config.yaml`，核心字段如下："
msgstr ""
"The global search configuration resides in "
"`configs/optuna/optuna_config.yaml`, featuring the following core fields:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:60
#: 18404c791bb54ad0999d31f09c5fc992
msgid ""
"# Optuna study 级别配置\n"
"sampler: tpe             # 采样算法: tpe (Tree-structured Parzen Estimator) |"
" random | nsgaii\n"
"sampler_kwargs:\n"
"  seed: 42\n"
"  n_startup_trials: 10   # 前 10 次试验采用随机采样建立初始先验\n"
"\n"
"pruner: median           # 剪枝策略: median | percentile | successive_halving"
" | hyperband | null\n"
"pruner_kwargs:\n"
"  n_startup_trials: 5    # 前 5 次试验不进行剪枝\n"
"  n_warmup_steps: 10     # 每个 Trial 前 10 个 Epoch 不剪枝\n"
"\n"
"n_trials: 100            # 总试验次数\n"
"n_jobs: 1                # 并行进程数（单卡建议保持为 1）\n"
"timeout: null            # 超时时间（秒，null 表示无限制）\n"
"study_name: hyperparameter_search\n"
"db_url: null             # 数据库 URL（默认为本地 SQLite study.db）\n"
"save_dir: ./optuna_results\n"
"verbose: 1\n"
msgstr ""
"# Optuna study-level configuration\n"
"sampler: tpe             # Sampling algorithm: tpe (Tree-structured "
"Parzen Estimator) | random | nsgaii\n"
"sampler_kwargs:\n"
"  seed: 42\n"
"  n_startup_trials: 10   # The first 10 trials sample randomly to build "
"the initial prior\n"
"\n"
"pruner: median           # Pruning strategy: median | percentile | "
"successive_halving | hyperband | null\n"
"pruner_kwargs:\n"
"  n_startup_trials: 5    # No pruning during the first 5 trials\n"
"  n_warmup_steps: 10     # No pruning during the first 10 epochs of each "
"trial\n"
"\n"
"n_trials: 100            # Total number of trials\n"
"n_jobs: 1                # Number of parallel workers (keep at 1 for a "
"single GPU)\n"
"timeout: null            # Timeout in seconds (null means unlimited)\n"
"study_name: hyperparameter_search\n"
"db_url: null             # Database URL (defaults to the local SQLite "
"study.db)\n"
"save_dir: ./optuna_results\n"
"verbose: 1"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:81
#: 5d1e2f7aa0394df4acb3ba06a5bac064
msgid "常见配置调优建议"
msgstr "Practical Tuning Recommendations"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:83
#: 1702def89e6c4c5ba3c12b00f76e094e
msgid "**算力有限**：将 `n_trials` 调小至 `30`~`50`，并开启 `pruner: median` 以便尽早淘汰劣质参数组合。"
msgstr ""
"**Constrained Compute**: Set `n_trials` to `30`~`50` and enable `pruner: "
"median` to prune unpromising trials early."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:84
#: fe8ee707a6804a9f8817893e7973a43a
msgid "**多目标优化**：将 `sampler` 改为 `nsgaii`（非支配排序遗传算法）。"
msgstr ""
"**Multi-Objective Optimization**: Switch `sampler` to `nsgaii` (Non-"
"dominated Sorting Genetic Algorithm II)."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:85
#: 0960250bd37f4fb48dd5724483f0042c
msgid "**无剪枝纯评估**：若训练轮数较短或模型损失波动剧烈，可将 `pruner` 设为 `null` 避免误剪。"
msgstr ""
"**Unpruned Evaluation**: If training epochs are short or loss "
"fluctuations are noisy, set `pruner` to `null` to avoid premature "
"pruning."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:87
#: b274873329c0498e8c5f95b656858756
msgid "试验中断与断点恢复"
msgstr "Trial Interruption and Checkpoint Resumption"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:89
#: b71d20f45c6f4d1abc40429614baf6d8
msgid "如果超参数搜索因节点维护或意外断电中断，只需指定上一次的实验运行目录即可无缝继续："
msgstr ""
"If hyperparameter search is interrupted by maintenance or outages, resume"
" seamlessly by specifying the previous run directory:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:91
#: 8b2188d369164cbe82404951a1641144
msgid ""
"python optuna_search.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --optuna_search.resume "
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_n_trials100\n"
msgstr ""
"python optuna_search.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --optuna_search.resume "
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_n_trials100\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:96
#: d190abc1e65543df9ffd1b71aab1d13c
msgid "恢复时，UniKT 会自动连接已有目录下的 `study.db`，读取历史完成的 Trial 状态，并基于已积累的贝叶斯先验继续执行剩余的试验轮次。"
msgstr ""
"Upon resumption, UniKT reconnects to `study.db` in the directory, "
"recovers completed trial histories, and leverages accumulated Bayesian "
"priors to continue remaining trials."

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:98
#: eb8b590e26a24bd680d57136c013f4d8
msgid "产出物与结果分析"
msgstr "Artifacts and Result Analysis"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:100
#: c83e07b56735449899db4a5bb99a0a79
msgid "搜索完成后，实验目录将生成以下核心文件："
msgstr ""
"Following search completion, the experiment directory produces the "
"following core files:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:102
#: 3730e7f8ff6447e7a67d5d8bb248e59a
msgid ""
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_n_trials100/\n"
"├── study.db                      # SQLite 格式的 Optuna 完整试验数据库\n"
"├── best_run_config.yaml          # 最优超参数组合构成的完整 RunConfig 配置文件\n"
"├── trials_history_gikt.csv       # 包含所有试验参数、得分、耗时、状态的表格\n"
"└── run.log                       # 搜索全流程日志记录\n"
msgstr ""
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_n_trials100/\n"
"├── study.db                  # Optuna SQLite study database\n"
"├── optuna_study_summary.csv  # Flattened parameter and metric records "
"across all trials\n"
"├── best_params.yaml          # Optimal hyperparameter dictionary "
"snapshot\n"
"├── best_run_config.yaml      # Complete RunConfig with best parameters "
"injected (for one-click reproduction)\n"
"└── optuna_search.log         # Complete terminal search log\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:110
#: 710649e594a0438481436c8bfb1f8f03
msgid "1. 使用最优配置一键重跑"
msgstr "1\\. One-Click Reproduction with Best Configuration"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:112
#: 8158827c3afa41d0b85500451b42411d
msgid ""
"系统生成的 `best_run_config.yaml` "
"已经将调优后的最优参数覆盖到位，且恢复了正常的检查点保存与测试集评估行为。你可以直接将其作为配置文件重新启动标准训练："
msgstr ""
"The generated `best_run_config.yaml` has the optimal parameters injected,"
" restoring standard checkpoint saving and test evaluation. You can pass "
"it directly to launch standard training:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:114
#: d9a895901be044b38743f79d3853f74c
msgid ""
"python train.py --config "
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_n_trials100/best_run_config.yaml"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"python train.py --config "
"runs/hyperparam_search/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_n_trials100/best_run_config.yaml"
"\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:118
#: 46070b40b1db4a749efa5a8e1eb5bed3
msgid "2. 通过 Optuna Dashboard 交互式查看"
msgstr "2\\. Interactive Exploration via Optuna Dashboard"

#: ../../source/user-guides/hyperparameter-search.md:120
#: 943fff1b75024e0aba320ea3132cd55b
msgid "通过 Web 界面直观查看超参数重要性分析图、平行坐标图及帕累托前沿曲线："
msgstr ""
"Explore parameter importance rankings, parallel coordinates, and Pareto "
"frontiers visually via the Web UI:"

